1
00:00:34,240 --> 00:00:35,200
Let me go!

2
00:00:38,700 --> 00:00:40,100
Keep him quiet.

3
00:00:40,120 --> 00:00:41,240
Let me go!

4
00:00:41,620 --> 00:00:42,420
Yes.

5
00:00:49,740 --> 00:00:51,340
Do you really have to do this?

6
00:01:00,060 --> 00:01:01,140
I have no choice.

7
00:01:10,920 --> 00:01:12,520
Are you taking revenge on me?

8
00:01:13,220 --> 00:01:15,610
[Eclipse in the Lost City] [Episode 16]

9
00:01:17,220 --> 00:01:18,020
Lu Ye,

10
00:01:18,500 --> 00:01:22,020
this is our destiny.

11
00:01:34,780 --> 00:01:35,580
Tianbai.

12
00:01:36,950 --> 00:01:38,550
I almost forgot.

13
00:01:38,570 --> 00:01:40,289
Young Master Lu is our guest.

14
00:01:40,830 --> 00:01:43,150
We haven't even offered him tea yet.

15
00:02:26,710 --> 00:02:30,230
I will never let you off.

16
00:02:37,420 --> 00:02:38,340
Enough.

17
00:02:40,300 --> 00:02:41,100
Yes.

18
00:02:42,140 --> 00:02:43,380
Keep him alive.

19
00:02:43,380 --> 00:02:44,910
He serves another purpose.

20
00:03:01,860 --> 00:03:04,140
What is your answer now?

21
00:03:07,700 --> 00:03:08,960
I'll take you to see him

22
00:03:09,520 --> 00:03:10,580
to clear things up.

23
00:03:12,320 --> 00:03:13,200
No need.

24
00:03:13,300 --> 00:03:14,560
I believe your master.

25
00:03:14,780 --> 00:03:15,580
This is fake.

26
00:03:16,100 --> 00:03:17,820
This form was signed in the afternoon.

27
00:03:17,820 --> 00:03:20,420
But Wu Ren wasn't in Ningcheng
that afternoon.

28
00:03:21,620 --> 00:03:22,579
I remember now.

29
00:03:22,900 --> 00:03:24,340
Master clocked in that morning.

30
00:03:24,340 --> 00:03:25,900
His name was on the attendance sheet.

31
00:03:25,900 --> 00:03:29,540
The person who framed him
thought he was in Ningcheng all day.

32
00:03:31,820 --> 00:03:34,880
But I still don't understand
why the signature is real.

33
00:03:45,100 --> 00:03:46,540
Signed-blank leave slips.

34
00:03:46,540 --> 00:03:48,820
The police have a habit of signing
blank leave slips.

35
00:03:48,820 --> 00:03:50,740
If it's mixed in a pile of leave slips,

36
00:03:50,740 --> 00:03:52,400
it might be signed by mistake.

37
00:03:52,620 --> 00:03:55,420
This mole knows your master's
working style very well.

38
00:03:55,420 --> 00:03:57,480
Can you guess who framed your master?

39
00:04:02,940 --> 00:04:04,400
-Xu Qingdao.
-Xu Qingdao.

40
00:04:05,820 --> 00:04:07,180
With all your fuss,

41
00:04:07,180 --> 00:04:08,300
Hui went to prison,

42
00:04:08,470 --> 00:04:10,900
and Xu Qingdao lost his vice presidency
of the Chamber of Commerce,

43
00:04:10,900 --> 00:04:12,860
which cut off his path to legitimacy.

44
00:04:12,860 --> 00:04:15,980
He knew you still held a grudge
about your father's death,

45
00:04:15,980 --> 00:04:17,579
so he decided to shift the blame.

46
00:04:17,579 --> 00:04:20,399
If he could cause a conflict
between you and the police,

47
00:04:20,399 --> 00:04:21,860
that would be even better.

48
00:04:22,340 --> 00:04:23,140
Besides,

49
00:04:24,020 --> 00:04:26,220
he told me to tie you up
and take you back.

50
00:04:26,740 --> 00:04:28,940
Then do as he says and take me back.

51
00:04:30,210 --> 00:04:32,380
You want to beat him at his own game?

52
00:04:33,260 --> 00:04:34,060
Smart.

53
00:04:36,860 --> 00:04:38,260
But it's very dangerous.

54
00:04:39,500 --> 00:04:41,300
I have to go
no matter how dangerous it is.

55
00:04:41,300 --> 00:04:42,659
We've been at this for so long.

56
00:04:42,659 --> 00:04:44,860
If you want to completely gain
Xu Qingdao's trust,

57
00:04:44,860 --> 00:04:46,180
we must put on a show.

58
00:04:47,100 --> 00:04:48,430
This is an opportunity.

59
00:04:49,220 --> 00:04:52,080
Have you figured out
how to tie me up and take me back?

60
00:04:52,500 --> 00:04:54,230
Knock you out and take you away.

61
00:04:54,990 --> 00:04:56,920
Someone is watching us over there.

62
00:05:02,920 --> 00:05:03,720
Bear with it.

63
00:05:19,500 --> 00:05:22,060
How did you lure Lu Ye out?

64
00:05:22,500 --> 00:05:24,980
Just tell him clues about Lu Wenbiao,

65
00:05:25,140 --> 00:05:26,800
and he will naturally show up.

66
00:05:28,760 --> 00:05:30,640
He's still as naive as before.

67
00:05:31,660 --> 00:05:34,700
It seems the resentment runs deep.

68
00:05:35,940 --> 00:05:39,100
I hate his innocent look the most.

69
00:05:39,590 --> 00:05:42,470
Why should he have everything
at such a young age?

70
00:05:42,620 --> 00:05:44,020
Well said.

71
00:05:44,260 --> 00:05:47,500
Destiny is something
you have to earn yourself.

72
00:05:49,500 --> 00:05:50,300
Yes.

73
00:05:50,659 --> 00:05:52,320
It's almost a full moon again.

74
00:05:52,380 --> 00:05:54,620
You've been working hard lately.

75
00:05:55,700 --> 00:05:56,620
Take it.

76
00:05:57,700 --> 00:05:58,700
Thank you, Chief.

77
00:06:23,380 --> 00:06:25,460
Lu Ye is full of tricks.

78
00:06:25,620 --> 00:06:27,260
I don't trust anyone else to watch him.

79
00:06:27,260 --> 00:06:28,060
Tianbai,

80
00:06:28,060 --> 00:06:29,920
I need you to put in some extra work

81
00:06:30,300 --> 00:06:31,500
and keep an eye on him for me tonight.

82
00:06:31,500 --> 00:06:32,100
Yes.

83
00:06:37,780 --> 00:06:39,280
Lu Ye.

84
00:06:41,940 --> 00:06:42,580
Lu Ye.

85
00:06:50,260 --> 00:06:50,860
Lu Ye,

86
00:06:50,860 --> 00:06:51,659
wake up.

87
00:06:53,140 --> 00:06:53,620
Lu Ye.

88
00:06:53,940 --> 00:06:54,740
Lu Ye.

89
00:06:56,700 --> 00:06:57,380
Lu Ye!

90
00:06:58,100 --> 00:06:59,700
Lu Ye!

91
00:06:59,900 --> 00:07:00,900
Wake up, Lu Ye!

92
00:07:00,900 --> 00:07:01,540
Lu Ye!

93
00:07:01,940 --> 00:07:03,260
Lu Ye!

94
00:07:03,620 --> 00:07:04,180
Lu...

95
00:07:06,940 --> 00:07:08,600
You fell for it more than once.

96
00:07:12,500 --> 00:07:13,420
Are you okay?

97
00:07:15,220 --> 00:07:15,860
And you?

98
00:07:16,260 --> 00:07:16,980
I'm fine.

99
00:07:16,980 --> 00:07:17,620
I...

100
00:07:30,020 --> 00:07:30,820
Shen Tianbai.

101
00:07:32,240 --> 00:07:33,180
Shen Tianbai!

102
00:07:43,840 --> 00:07:44,640
Shen Tianbai!

103
00:07:57,480 --> 00:07:58,620
Lock the door.

104
00:07:59,070 --> 00:08:02,670
Tomorrow morning,
after Shen Tianbai recovers,

105
00:08:03,500 --> 00:08:04,700
let him out

106
00:08:05,540 --> 00:08:08,740
and collect Lu Ye's body.

107
00:08:08,980 --> 00:08:09,620
Yes.

108
00:08:29,700 --> 00:08:31,030
Don't force me to shoot!

109
00:08:43,960 --> 00:08:45,200
I understand.

110
00:08:45,220 --> 00:08:48,620
It just depends on
whether he can survive tonight.

111
00:08:50,060 --> 00:08:51,300
You must be joking.

112
00:08:51,900 --> 00:08:55,460
He's just a beast
who can talk like a human.

113
00:08:55,910 --> 00:08:57,510
I'm okay with it if he's gone.

114
00:08:57,540 --> 00:08:58,740
Why would I blame you?

115
00:09:01,780 --> 00:09:03,020
Snap out of it!

116
00:09:16,860 --> 00:09:21,420
I've already chosen the best prey for him.

117
00:09:36,160 --> 00:09:37,680
Oh, Lu Ye,

118
00:09:38,020 --> 00:09:41,580
you'll be dead by tomorrow morning.

119
00:10:02,300 --> 00:10:03,820
Do you remember?

120
00:10:04,340 --> 00:10:05,940
We used to fight in school.

121
00:10:06,740 --> 00:10:08,940
We are friends.

122
00:10:10,250 --> 00:10:11,380
I won't hurt you.

123
00:10:12,220 --> 00:10:13,420
And you won't hurt me.

124
00:10:13,980 --> 00:10:14,820
Wake up,

125
00:10:15,250 --> 00:10:16,170
okay?

126
00:10:29,330 --> 00:10:30,130
Want it?
